，深受附近居民與學生族群的喜愛。這家拉麵店的特色是湯頭非常濃郁香甜，可以選擇豚骨、味增、鹽味、醬油四種口味，配上彈牙的拉麵和嫩滑的糖心蛋，讓人一吃上癮。除了拉麵之外，也有丼飯及台式小菜，如燙青菜、豆乾海帶等，增加飽足感和平衡感。另外，還有炸雞、唐揚雞等丼飯和小吃，都是無骨的，吃起來鮮嫩多汁也不會油膩。如果你想品嘗正宗的日式拉麵，又不想花太多錢，那麼台北淡水彩日式拉麵是一個不錯的選擇。",null,[0,258]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1338991482623741927/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUndlblpRWTJWUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1338991482623741927/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUndlblpRWTJWUkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1338991482623741927/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUndlblpRWTJWUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1338991482623741927/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUndlblpRWTJWUkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1338991482623741927/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUndlblpRWTJWUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1338991482623741927/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUndlblpRWTJWUkVBRRAA"]],[null,null,5056,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURwenZQY2VREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xf792938c197458bf!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDpzvPceQ%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURwenZQY2VREAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURwenZQY2VREi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRHB6dlBjLVFFEhNDZ3dJOWNHUnB3WVE4TU9abkFFGi0KFkNJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRHB6dlBjQlESE0Nnd0k5Y0dScHdZUThNT1puQUUiEgkAAAAAAAAAABG_WHQZjJOS9yoLMFp0NTJwSVdhNms\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiM3tKj8NSWAxWfdvUHHentCRcQoykI7wEoFg"],null,[null,[[1,2]]]],"0ahUKEwjsz9yj8NSWAxUij8oCHYFcPasQ0pMFCH4oBg"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiM3tKj8NSWAxWfdvUHHentCRcQ0pMFCMUBKAY"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2toYVIyRlJkM0ZSTW5saWNXczFjbVZaVFhWNGVYYxAB",["0x0:0xf792938c197458bf",null,177286520632