HCPsBKAc",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["第一次吃這一間\n真的不能相信評價\n雖然醬油拉麵的味道偏淡\n但還是能喝到大骨高湯的味道\n而且是非常濃郁的大骨高湯味\n\n如果你本身是吃口味偏淡的人\n可以試試看醬油拉麵\n但如果你本身是吃比較重口味的\n可以試試味噌拉麵\n\n叉燒的部分也都有標示清楚\n看你要一片還是三片\n我強烈推薦點三片\n他的叉燒非常嫩\n一入口 不太需要咀嚼\n會直接在嘴巴裡面化開\n\n整體來說\n是非常值得推薦來吃的一間拉麵店",null,[0,28]]]],[null,1773054942000000,1773054942000000,"5 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfUGktWXBqMk1kODZaWktxbDBjNlc4UQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfUGktWXBqMk1kODZaWktxbDBjNlc4URoTQ2d3STN0ZTZ6UVlRN3VuUDlnSQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiM3tKj8NSWAxWfdvUHHentCRcQ_2MI_QEoCA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1338991482623741927/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvWVZJeVJsSmtNMFpTVFc1c2FXTlhjekZqYlZaYVZGaFdOR1ZZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1338991482623741927/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvWVZJeVJsSmtNMFpTVFc1c2FXTlhjekZqYlZaYVZGaFdOR1ZZWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1338991482623741927/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvWVZJeVJsSmtNMFpTVFc1c2FXTlhjekZqYlZaYVZGaFdOR1ZZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1338991482623741927/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvWVZJeVJsSmtNMFpTVFc1c2FXTlhjekZqYlZaYVZGaFdOR1ZZWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1338991482623741927/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvWVZJeVJsSmtNMFpTVFc1c2FXTlhjekZqYlZaYVZGaFdOR1ZZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1338991482623741927/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvWVZJeVJsSmtNMFpTVFc1c2FXTlhjekZqYlZaYVZGaFdOR1ZZWXhBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[[" 親愛的顧客您好：\n\n您確實是精於品嚐的饕客與小店的知音；對本店來說提供料真實在，令顧客滿意的餐點，向來是我們的目標，能得到客戶的好評，是我們持續精進的動力。\n\n不同於有些店家以高湯粉應付大量需求，本店確實是每日以新鮮大骨及多種時蔬、水果熬煮的高湯𤔡底，再佐以不同口味的獨特醬料做成清淡的醬油、鹽味拉麵，及濃郁的豚骨、味噌拉麵等4種口味。其中味噌口味微辣，且附有七味粉、辣油、蒜蓉等調味品，提供客戶自行依所需微調。\n\n叉燒肉亦經獨家配方燉燒入味後切片，肉嫩味鮮， 確與一般炙燒的有所區別，歡迎客戶多多光臨品嚐。\n\n另對於因對味而胃口大開的來店顧客，也提供可免費加麵一次的服務，期望客人既能吃巧也能吃飽。\n\n期待您的再次到訪。",null,[0,79]]]],[null,null,2074,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2toYVIyRlJkM0ZSTW5saWNXczFjbVZaVFhWNGVYYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xf792938c197458bf!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkhaR2FRd3FRMnlicWs1cmVZTXV4eXc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2toYVIyRlJkM0ZSTW5saWNXczFjbVZaVFhWNGVYYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2toYVIyRlJkM0ZSTW5saWNXczFjbVZaVFhWNGVYYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2toYVIyRlJkM0ZSTW5saWNXczFjbVZaVFhWNGVYYxILMGRld1BxSUVLNjUaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09raGFSMkZSZDNGUk1ubGljV3MxY21WWlRYVjRlWGMSCzBkZXdQcUlFSzY1IhIJAAAAAAAAAAARv1h0GYyTkvcqCzBkZXdQcUlFSzY1\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiM3tKj8NSWAxWfdvUHHentCRcQoykI_gEoCQ"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwjsz9yj8NSWAxUij8oCHYFcPasQ0pMFCKkBKAc"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiM3tKj8NSWAxWfdvUHHentCRcQ0pMFCPABKAc"]],null,null,null,"other_user_google_review_posts__and__hotel_and_vr_partner_review_posts",null,"CjEIARIpCgoAP7_LAf9b____EhBgKuMYX-4rWSjXY-UAAAAAGgn92T0CYzj_x80YACIA"]],null,null,null,[3,1,null,null,null,[2]]],null,null,[["02 2623 8780",[["02 2623 8780",1],["+886 2 2623 8780",2]],null,"0226238780",null,["tel:0226238780",null,null,"0ahUKEwiM3tKj8NSWAxWfdvUHHentCRcQ_doBCA0oCg"]]],null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,"1338991482623741927","113568356083919377744"],null,[[[7,[["彩日式拉麵專賣店"],["251新北市淡水區幸福里英專路2巷5-2號"]]],[2,[["251新北市淡水區幸福里英專路2巷5-2號彩日式拉麵專賣店"]]],[1,[["251新北市淡水區幸福里英專路2巷5-2號"]]],[4,[["新北市淡水區幸福里"]]]],[null,"英專路2巷5-2號","英專路2巷5-2號","幸福里","251","新北市淡水區","TW"],["0ahUKEwiM3tKj8NSWAxWfdvUHHentCRcQqtMBCAkoBg",["7QQ35C9W+H8"],["5C9W+H8 幸福里 新北市淡水區"],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[["星期五",5,[2026,9,4],[["11:30–20:00